        {
          "id": 1543572154,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I didn't want to disturb the logic in the macros (I'm sure they do avoid copy/paste, but there must be a more readable way...) that are used here, where whk_0a_Declarations does extract val_id from the byte at position hdr_start + 1 (which is the highlighted position, val_start).\n\nSo I could use an API as you suggested that reads from the TVB, but I wasn't comfortable with doing that (this is why I passed on this change first time I saw the report).",
